- [38;5;10mhelperGood1[0m's [38;5;10mstatic char charString[][0m became an immutable Rust [38;5;10mstatic[0m cast to [38;5;10m*mut c_char[0m, avoiding [38;5;10mstatic mut[0m internally. Nothing in this library writes through that pointer, so behavior is unchanged; the only difference is [38;5;10m.rodata[0m vs [38;5;10m.data[0m placement, which is not observable here. It would matter if an external caller wrote through the returned pointer.[0m[0m
